===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/spɔː/}} {{italbrac|[[RP]]}}
* {{a|US}} {{IPA|/spɔːɹ/|/spoʊɹ/}}
* {{rhymes|ɔː(r)}}

===Etymology===
From Modern Latin {{term|spora|lang=la}}, from {{etyl|grc}} {{term|σπορά|lang=grc|sc=polytonic|tr=spora||seed, a sowing}}, related to {{term|σπόρος|lang=grc|sc=polytonic|tr=sporos||sowing}} and {{term|σπείρω|lang=grc|sc=polytonic|tr=speirō||to sow}}, from PIE *sper- "to strew"

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}
{{wikipedia}}

# A [[reproductive]] particle, usually a single [[cell]], released by a [[fungus]], [[alga]], or [[plant]] that may [[germinate]] into another.
# A [[thick]] [[resistant]] particle produced by a [[bacterium]] or [[protist]] to survive in [[harsh]] or [[unfavorable]] conditions.

